{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/OMB_gameplay_03.gif?t=1753443804\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>You are a Button</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imagine  the buttons popped out of your controllers and  leapt right into the screen. That's the unique concept behind <strong>One More Button</strong>. You play as the  circle button. To move around, you'll press the arrow buttons scattered around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/OMB_Gameplay_TwoButtons.gif?t=1753443804\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Brain-Melting Puzzles</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push, press, and twist your way to the goal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Need to take a step back? The <strong>redo</strong> and <strong>undo</strong> buttons make retrying easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/OMB_Gameplay_PinkTwist.gif?t=1753443804\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>In a Beautiful Hand Drawn World</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a variety of mysterious worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each packed with unique gimmicks and mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/OMB_Gameplay_Ice.gif?t=1753443804\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623490?t=1753443804","backgro